<section class="service-section">
  <div class="container" data-controller="tabs">
    <!-- Service Header -->
    <h2 class="service-title">Oil Change & Maintenance</h2>

    <!-- Image Section -->
    <div class="service-images">
      <img src="image1.jpg" alt="Mechanic Working" />
      <img src="image2.jpg" alt="Engine Maintenance" />
    </div>

    <!-- Service Details -->
    <div class="service-details">
      <h3>Oil Change</h3>
      <div class="underline"></div>
      <p>
      Every vehicle manufacturer has a recommendation on types and grades of engine oil to use. They also give some guidelines as to how often the oils should be changed. We leave that completely up to the customer, we just make some recommendations.

      Majority Specialists and scientists agree that synthetic oils offer numerous advantages overtraditional products. Under extreme operating conditions, synthetics offer better protection of engine and engine components. Also, the use of synthetics means a longer lubricant service life and fewer oil changes. Using a total synthetic lubricant family of products can improve fuel economy savings by as much as 5 percent annually.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab Section -->
    <div class="tabs">
      <button data-action="click->tabs#showTab" data-tabs-target="detailsTab">Details</button>
      <button data-action="click->tabs#showTab" data-tabs-target="maintenanceTab">Maintenance</button>
      <button data-action="click->tabs#showTab" data-tabs-target="questionsTab">Popular Questions</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab Content -->
    <div class="tab-content">
      <!-- Details Tab -->
      <div data-tabs-target="detailsTab" class="tab active">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <th>Recommended Engine Oil</th>
            <td>Chevron 400 Delo 15W40</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Synthetic Engine Oil</th>
            <td>Chevron 400 Delo 10W30</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Oil Filters</th>
            <td>Volvo OEM, Donaldson, Fleetguard</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Fuel Filters</th>
            <td>Original or Manufacturer recommended</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Heavy Duty Lube</th>
            <td>Transmission, Fifth Wheels, Steering Gear, Wheel Bearings</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Maintenance Tab -->
      <div data-tabs-target="maintenanceTab" class="tab">
        <ul>
          <li>Air & Cabin Filter</li>
          <li>Coolant Flush & Coolant Filter</li>
          <li>Valve Adjustment</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Questions Tab -->
      <div data-tabs-target="questionsTab" class="tab">
        <h4>What parts do you use for your service?</h4>
        <p>We use only original or manufacturer-recommended brands...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
